{"data":[{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"0_1745969255.531210","card_id":"Q_1900230974308071261","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46dce23b718e0531cb7d3a_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-c89199839c237b87e52f010bb5e7d773_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1900230974308071200,"title":"幸福航空被曝欠薪 9 个月，飞行员送外卖空姐卖爆米花自谋生计，该航司经营出了什么问题？具体情况如何？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1900230974308071261","type":"question","created":1745830368,"answer_count":209,"follower_count":729,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[2566,15468,105508,2219109,3699616],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"4月27日晚，幸福航空官方网站发布《关于幸福航空官网及微官网不正常航班延误证明功能暂停的通知》，称近期进行优化升级，系统暂停不正常航班延误证明功能，后续恢复正常后将及时通知。@荔枝新闻记者采访多名幸福航空员工，他们均表示好几个月没拿到工资，社保公积金很久不交，只能自己找活养家糊口，飞行员为了谋生送外卖、做家教，空姐卖爆米花，安全员跑滴滴等。 荔枝新闻记者查询幸福航空多趟航班信息，4月28日至30日的状态均显示为“取消”或“暂无数据”。据了解 幸福航空2024年在审理中的案件有66个，其中近半数案件的案由是“劳动争议”，幸福航空飞行员、空乘、地勤等多个岗位的员工被公司拖欠工资。https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20250428V0715M00?uid=8QMf2Xxf64AYsDff&chlid=user_center&suid=8QMf2Xxf64AYsDff&cur_vid=f1131lx6fva"},"attached_info":"CkoIr/7Et821lq9AEAMaCTExNDcyMzg0NiDgg73ABjAAONkFQAByEzE5MDAyMzA5NzQzMDgwNzEyNjF4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"112 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-f2939bb18e68818e19f694773e5399ec_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"1_1745969255.532526","card_id":"Q_12651469462","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46dce23b718e0531cb7d3a_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-c89199839c237b87e52f010bb5e7d773_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":12651469462,"title":"美国的蓝领收入比某些白领要高，为什么大家不全部去做蓝领？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/12651469462","type":"question","created":1739893602,"answer_count":79,"follower_count":131,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[472,11933],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"比如，美国的银行柜台员工是白领，在旧金山的年薪才五万美元左右。美国的小学老师或者中学老师也是白领，在旧金山第一年的年薪不足六万美元。但是美国修车的工人在旧金山的入职年薪是十万美元，扫地工人在旧金山机场加上加班费是十四万美元年薪，修复印机工人也是蓝领，时薪90美元。在美国扫地，修车，修复印机这些都不需要大学学位，但是要当个老师，不仅需要大学学位，还要考入门试，再读两年的师范，至少读六年大学才能有资格考证书试，及格了才能教书。为什么还会有人去当白领比如老师，为什么大家不都全部去当蓝领工人？"},"attached_info":"CkIIr/7Et821lq9AEAMaCTExMzUwNjAzNyDi1tK9BjAAOIMBQAFyCzEyNjUxNDY5NDYyeACqAQliaWxsYm9hcmTSAQA=","detail_text":"106 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-18133e98e59cc5bbf1976d67ab666130_720w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"2_1745969255.533180","card_id":"Q_1900756306937250670","card_label":{"type":"new","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-a4b0b52b561281109c51e4957cb20130_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-10ef6526c602e55a8c606e46aa0cc586_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1900756306937250600,"title":"24-25赛季欧冠半决赛首回合阿森纳0-1不敌巴黎圣日耳曼，如何评价本场比赛双方的表现？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1900756306937250670","type":"question","created":1745955617,"answer_count":23,"follower_count":25,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[2955,7813,12382,41079,3688159],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkkIr/7Et821lq9AEAMaCTExNDc0NTc1MiCh1sTABjAAOBlAAnITMTkwMDc1NjMwNjkzNzI1MDY3MHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"99 万热度","trend":0,"debut":true,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-31d52697f756bb31d5e163eaadc06b00_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"3_1745969255.533483","card_id":"Q_13524300130","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46